                {
                    "file": "phosphor-power-supply/chassis.cpp",
                    "line": 45,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Shawn McCarney",
                        "email": "shawnmm@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "smccarney"
                    },
                    "message": "As noted in chassis.hpp, we shouldn't have variables named 'tmp'. Also, I think we want to pass in a chassis number rather than a chassis name. That number can be used to build the D-Bus paths.\n\nFor example, in one D-Bus path we might need '.../chassis1/...'.  In another path we might need '.../c1_...'. The chassis information in a D-Bus path will probably vary."
                },
                {
